[1] Submit the protein sequences to GPSFun web server at https://bio-web1.nscc-gz.cn/app/GPSFun
    Note:  the max number of protein sequences is 20.
           The max number of jobs is 5.

[2] Deal results
    e.g., python Deal_Results.py workdir
          workdir includes MF/BP/CC_term_list, evaluate/test_result/

[3] Copy Preidction Results
    e.g., cp -r ./back/ ./dataset/
          python Copy_Results ./benchmark/ ./dataset/
[4] Evaluation
    e.g., python Evaluate_All_Pipelines ./dataset/
